# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile (P10-1, ADR 0043 S3). Secrets, local state and anything
# the build does not need stay out, so they can never land in a layer or a build log. Patterns
# are anchored at the context root unless they start with `**/`, so every dotenv, key and
# per-user npm config is listed in the nested form too (`apps/web/.env.local` would otherwise
# reach `vite build`, which inlines VITE_* values into the served app).
.git
.github
.claude
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
artifacts
test-results
playwright-report
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.env
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/github-app.env
deploy/setup
design-poc
docs
**/*.md
.DS_Store
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
packages/evals/reports
